  "skill_summaries": {
    "ultimate": "summon ghosts to bombard random enemies",
    "skill1": "HP sacrifice fires orb line, dealing area damage",
    "skill2": "sacrifice HP to deal damage; sacrifice summons for extra AoE damage",
    "skill3": "battle energy recovery from attacks grows with summon count",
    "skill4": "summon expiry converts remaining power to all-enemy damage",
    "skill5": "each hero defeat spawns an extra summon"
  },
  "play_overview": "Shemira **sacrifices HP to fuel damage**, firing orb lines and AoE bursts as her health pool shrinks. She **summons ghosts** to bombard random enemies, and each hero defeat **spawns an extra summon** to widen pressure. Energy recovery from attacks **scales with summon count**, rewarding teams that keep bodies on the field. When summons expire, **remaining power converts to all-enemy damage** for a closing burst. She needs **healing to cycle sacrifices** safely. Without sustain or summons, her HP costs leave her exposed quickly.",
  "counter_overview": "Shemira **burns her own HP** to fire orbs, then her **slow ultimate** floods the board with **random ghost bombardment** that widens as heroes fall. Attrition and summon count favour her unless you **end the fight early**. Delete her before the procession locks in with [[filter:assassin-delete]] like [[Nara]] or [[Himmel]], blunt the ultimate with [[Lily May]], and **deny the HP recovery** that fuels her sacrifices with [[filter:heal-inhibitor]] like [[Frieren]] or [[Gwyneth]]. Race her with a sped-up carry ([[filter:energy-provider]] like [[Thador]] or [[Hugin]])."
